": 1}, {"text": "(2a+3)(46+2)=2(2a+3)(2b+1)，其中（2a", "x": 425, "y": 1084, "x2": 763, "y2": 1108, "score": 0.896, "col": 1}, {"text": "原创制作-公众号：中小学教辅电子资料微信：412255978 29", "x": 261, "y": 1131, "x2": 812, "y2": 1155, "score": 0.999, "col": 1}]}, "31": {"size": [850, 1163], "lines": [{"text": "学而思秘籍小学数学思维培养8级", "x": 124, "y": 31, "x2": 402, "y2": 57, "score": 0.994, "col": 0}, {"text": "+3)+(2b+1)=2(a+6)+4=32，则当(2a+", "x": 94, "y": 87, "x2": 431, "y2": 110, "score": 0.851, "col": 0}, {"text": "3)=(2b+1)=16时，(2a+3)(2b+1)的最大", "x": 91, "y": 116, "x2": 431, "y2": 138, "score": 0.858, "col": 0}, {"text": "值为16×16=256，综上，大长方形的面积的最", "x": 92, "y": 144, "x2": 431, "y2": 168, "score": 0.977, "col": 0}, {"text": "大值为256×2=512(平方厘米）。", "x": 92, "y": 173, "x2": 337, "y2": 196, "score": 0.933, "col": 0}, {"text": "第15讲操作类智巧趣题", "x": 111, "y": 225, "x2": 410, "y2": 256, "score": 0.998, "col": 0}, {"text": "练习 1", "x": 90, "y": 286, "x2": 150, "y2": 310, "score": 0.959, "col": 0}, {"text": "【答案】见解析。", "x": 87, "y": 314, "x2": 205, "y2": 340, "score": 0.998, "col": 0}, {"text": "【解析】如下表：", "x": 87, "y": 343, "x2": 205, "y2": 369, "score": 0.955, "col": 0}, {"text": "次数 此岸 过河 彼岸", "x": 98, "y": 382, "x2": 373, "y2": 407, "score": 1.0, "col": 0}, {"text": "1 狼，白莱 农民，羊", "x": 107, "y": 414, "x2": 277, "y2": 440, "score": 0.961, "col": 0}, {"text": "狼，白菜 农民 羊", "x": 136, "y": 448, "x2": 365, "y2": 472, "score": 0.96, "col": 0}, {"text": "3 狼 农民，白菜 羊", "x": 105, "y": 482, "x2": 365, "y2": 506, "score": 0.995, "col": 0}, {"text": "4 狼 农民，羊 白菜", "x": 106, "y": 516, "x2": 372, "y2": 540, "score": 0.995, "col": 0}, {"text": "5 羊 农民，狼 白莱", "x": 104, "y": 548, "x2": 372, "y2": 572, "score": 0.958, "col": 0}, {"text": "6 羊 农民 狼，白菜", "x": 106, "y": 583, "x2": 384, "y2": 606, "score": 0.996, "col": 0}, {"text": "7 农民，羊 狼，白菜", "x": 106, "y": 618, "x2": 384, "y2": 640, "score": 0.995, "col": 0}, {"text": "农民，羊，狼，白菜", "x": 287, "y": 650, "x2": 416, "y2": 673, "score": 0.995, "col": 0}, {"text": "练习2", 